        "position_hint": 0.35,
        "routing_tag": "surface",
        "salience": 0.7667,
        "text": "Yeah, so \u2014 The most common mistake new builders make is grading too aggressively. Once you internalize that, the rest of the decisions get easier.",
        "tier": 2
      },
      "type": "Insight"
    },
    {
